{"seq":7,"slug":"english-writing-practice","title":"英语写作实战","stage":"DONE","category":"english-learning","chapterCount":6,"docCount":24,"url":"/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice","rating":{"composite":4.14,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":4,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":4.08,"verdict":"recommend","uScore":4.75}},"introMarkdown":"# 英语写作实战 简介\n\n英语写作能力是中国程序员参与全球化技术协作时最核心的硬技能之一。从每天收发的邮件和 Slack 消息，到简历、技术博客和设计文档，几乎所有职场产出都以书面英语为载体。然而，多数开发者在学校接受的英语写作训练侧重于考试作文，与真实职场环境中简洁、精准、面向行动的写作要求相去甚远。\n\n本知识库面向具有中级英语基础、正在或即将进入国际化团队工作的程序员与技术从业者。你不需要拥有完美的语法知识，但需要对\"如何用英语把事情说清楚\"抱有真诚的意愿。这里提供的不是语法教科书式的规则罗列，而是以场景为驱动、以产出为导向的写作实战方法论。\n\n全书共分六个章节：\n\n第一章**邮件写作精通**聚焦职场中最高频的书面沟通形式，从邮件结构与语气把控，到请求跟进、坏消息传达和复杂邮件线程管理，帮助你写出专业、得体、高效的商务邮件。\n\n第二章**技术文档写作**覆盖开发者日常产出的核心文档类型，包括 README 与 API 文档、代码注释与提交信息、PR 描述，以及变更日志与发版说明，建立工程写作的规范意识。\n\n第三章**职场即时通讯**处理节奏更快、容错更低的异步沟通场景，涵盖 Slack 礼仪与频道规范、状态更新与工作汇报、同事间的反馈与代码评审沟通，以及会议纪要与行动项的撰写。\n\n第四章**职业文档**关注个人职业发展中的关键写作场景，从简历撰写、求职信到绩效自评和晋升材料，教你用结构化的英语讲述自己的技术故事。\n\n第五章**长文写作**进入更具深度和影响力的写作领域，包括博客文章结构、教程写作、案例研究和 RFC 设计文档，帮助你在技术社区中建立专业声望。\n\n第六章**错误模式与润色**系统梳理中国程序员最常犯的英语写作错误，包括中式英语模式、冠词与介词误用、简洁性技巧，以及一套完整的自查清单，让你的英语写作质量实现质的飞跃。\n\n建议从第一章开始顺序阅读，邮件和即时通讯是最高频的练习场景，能快速建立写作信心。第四章可根据个人需求跳读。如果你的写作已有一定基础但总感觉\"不够地道\"，建议直接翻到第六章，从错误模式入手进行针对性提升。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"email-mastery","title":"邮件写作精通","docCount":4,"url":"/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/email-mastery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"email-structure-and-tone","title":"邮件结构与语气","url":"/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/email-mastery/email-structure-and-tone"},{"seq":2,"slug":"request-and-followup","title":"请求与跟进邮件","url":"/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/email-mastery/request-and-followup"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bad-news-and-escalation","title":"坏消息与升级邮件","url":"/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/email-mastery/bad-news-and-escalation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"email-thread-management","title":"邮件线程管理","url":"/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/email-mastery/email-thread-management"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"technical-documentation","title":"技术文档写作","docCount":4,"url":"/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/technical-documentation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"readme-and-api-docs","title":"README 与 API 文档","url":"/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/technical-documentation/readme-and-api-docs"},{"seq":2,"slug":"code-comments-and-commits","title":"代码注释与提交信息","url":"/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/technical-documentation/code-comments-and-commits"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pr-descriptions","title":"PR 描述写作","url":"/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/technical-documentation/pr-descriptions"},{"seq":4,"slug":"changelog-and-release-notes","title":"变更日志与发布说明","url":"/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/technical-documentation/changelog-and-release-notes"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"workplace-messaging","title":"职场即时通讯","docCount":4,"url":"/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/workplace-messaging","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"slack-etiquette","title":"Slack 礼仪","url":"/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/workplace-messaging/slack-etiquette"},{"seq":2,"slug":"status-updates-and-reports","title":"状态更新与报告","url":"/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/workplace-messaging/status-updates-and-reports"},{"seq":3,"slug":"feedback-and-peer-review","title":"反馈与同行评审","url":"/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/workplace-messaging/feedback-and-peer-review"},{"seq":4,"slug":"meeting-notes-and-actions","title":"会议纪要与行动项","url":"/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/workplace-messaging/meeting-notes-and-actions"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"career-documents","title":"职业文档","docCount":4,"url":"/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/career-documents","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"resume-writing","title":"简历写作","url":"/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/career-documents/resume-writing"},{"seq":2,